 Pricing exception specific to this product and customer, within active contract term\n\n## Conclusion\n\n**Yes, Sarah Chen could have approved this request.** \n\nCommercial eligibility is established through the active pricing exception. The 15% discount is exactly at the threshold of Sarah Chen's approval authority under the 2025 pricing policy. The request complies with the principle that contractual eligibility does not modify employee authority—it is the policy, not the contract, that grants her authority.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"APPROVE\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9004\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048; ERP: C-1001 Acme Mfg. Holdings)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-500 (list price $250,000)\",\n    \"requested_discount\": \"15.0%\",\n    \"date\": \"2025-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"sarah.chen@northstar.example (Sarah Chen, Enterprise Account Executive)\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"eligible\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": \"15%\",\n    \"basis\": \"Pricing Exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (Schedule B, Master Supply Agreement ACME-MFG-2025), active 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"Northstar Pricing Policy 2025\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": \"≤15%\",\n    \"requestor_authorized\": true,\n    \"required_role\": null,\n    \"approver\": null\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"Master Supply Agreement ACME-MFG-2025 (effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31)\",\n    \"Pricing Exception EXC-ACME-NS500-15: 15% maximum on NS-500 for Acme Manufacturing\",\n    \"Pricing Policy 2025: Enterprise Account Executive authority ≤15%\",\n    \"Organization Chart (2026-09-01): Sarah Chen confirmed as Enterprise Account Executive reporting to VP Sales\",\n    \"Products.csv: NS-500 list price $250,000\",\n    \"CRM Accounts: CRM-2048 (Acme Manufacturing, Strategic tier, Sarah Chen owner)\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": []\n}\n```"